r junior researcher sophia  ramirez location drago man tavern date  2911  2524 begin log ramirez is sitting in the  main room of the tavern at a table by a  window she has just switched on a  recording device and placed it in front  of her a tall burly man with a thick  beard osmanoglu is sitting opposite her  snow can be seen passing by the window  there is a lit fireplace behind  osmaniglu  thank you for agreeing to this interview  sergey  it's not a problem  i've got time and you pay the rent  promptly  i  oh okay  when did you first arrive in lamplight  2009 i think  it was a long time ago  what was the town like then  small  cold fewer buildings fewer lamps  less snow  yes i wanted to ask about that how is  there snow but it was better back then  delacroix was there  people said he founded the place  but they couldn't understand how they  could think that  what do you mean he didn't have the  energy  no spark  he'd spend all his time staring out  there into the dark  this place wasn't meant for us  and you can't know that for sure the  soil here is so perfectly suited to  supporting human life you don't make a  place for people with that thing  suspended over it you'll build a sun or  stars not a pallid half moon there are  no places for humans this far  other civilizations got close  sriska park red they weren't humans  wrong cluster  and if they did make this place and they  doubt it  then they are long gone now  nothing but their dust and their lamp  left over  so  what did delacroix do  he had a girl  and it went sour  so he came here to start something new  something great  but the only ones entranced by his mad  designs were the same old crowd of poets  all talking about the great utopia they  built here  another society of true freedom to  escape the horrors of the dozen others  they made  but they didn't want to do the hard  graft or come down from their bohemian  bubbles  so it was all pork shooting [ __ ] in  taverns like this one  i'm the only one le